 "_smx1_biome_legacy_basis": "smx1j (javap -c -p both code jars): 1.21.11's BiomeSpecialEffects is a record of water / foliage / dry foliage / grass colours and the grass modifier; 1.21.10's fog / water fog / sky colour, ambient particle, ambient sounds, background music and its volume are the biome's environment attributes (FOG_COLOR .. MUSIC_VOLUME). The nine getters 1.21.11 dropped, and reads of 1.21.10's private record fields (a mod's access widener), answer from the attributes of the biome the effects belong to (Biome's constructor records it, CbBiomeEffectsOwnerMixinHooks), in 1.21.10's form (RGB colours, one particle, the three sounds, the music as a weighted list); effects only a 1.21.10 builder built answer that builder's settings. Reads and writes of the Builder's dropped private fields go to what the restored setters keep (CbBiomeEffects.Settings), which build() hands on (rt/CbBiomeEffectsLegacy). Constructors reached through a mod's access widener (package-private in both releases): 1.21.10's 14-argument BiomeSpecialEffects becomes 1.21.11's record plus the settings a builder would have kept; 1.21.10's 4-argument Biome gets the attributes its effects stand for (CbBiomeEffects.attributes) as 1.21.11's Biome.Builder sets them (ctorRedirects; the layer's AW opens Biome.<init>).",
